# What ships in the *source* distribution.
#
# The wheel is already limited to the mcad2py package by
# [tool.setuptools.packages.find] in pyproject.toml. The sdist is broader by
# default -- setuptools sweeps in a top-level tests/ directory on its own -- so
# the development-only trees are pruned explicitly here.
#
# tests/ and references/ are excluded deliberately and go together: every test
# converts and executes a real .mcdx fixture from references/, so shipping the
# tests without the ~800 KB of worksheets would only ship something that cannot
# run. Both stay in the git repo; clone it to run the suite.

include README.md
include LICENSE

prune tests
prune references
prune docs
prune .claude
prune .github

global-exclude *.py[cod] __pycache__/* .DS_Store
